FreeGLM is a fork of Qwen-MM-Plugins that renames the project and adds a
Zhipu GLM-4.6V-Flash vision backend (provider routing for vision_chat / ocr /
grounding, video-to-frames degradation on the Zhipu backend, enable_thinking
isolation, and ZHIPU_* configuration/verification wiring).

